================================================================================================================

whenever there is any manual query from developer for performance apply following hint:
/*+ Full(a) parallel(a 12)  */
Here, a is alias name of table_name. use the alias name which is accessed more.

Different Hints that can be applied
-- SELECT /*+ LEADING(T10)  INDEX_SS(T10 S_EVT_ACT_10589M_X) INDEX(T10 S_EVT_ACT_20071 _X) */
-- SELECT /*+ ALL_ROWS leading(T5) index(T5 S_VOD_VER_45030_X) */
-- SELECT /*QC_44437_SQL1_1_4BKS792*/
-- SELECT /*+ USE_CONCAT LEADING(T11) INDEX(T11 S_ORDER_ITEM_OM_36983_X) INDEX(T11 S_ORDER_ITEM_OM_16780_X)*/ 
-- SELECT /*+ FULL(asset) PARALLEL(12)*/

// Use below command to check unique values in table, the table where u get more unique values apply hint on that column
Syntax: select count(DISTINCT <column_name>) FROM SIEBEL.<table_name>;

Example: select /*+ FULL(S_ORDER_ITEM_OM) PARALLEL(8) */ count(DISTINCT CMPND_PROD_NUM) FROM SIEBEL.S_ORDER_ITEM_OM;


