################################################################################################################################################

DR steps for GG(Switchover)

(1) stop the appln on O13 and make sure that all objects such as jobs(should be in disabled)

 
(2) ASG needs to confirm that there are no transactions coming on O13 DB and also on O15 DB

 
(3) stop the extract , pump on O13 ( perform logend) - showtrans

 
(4) stop the replicats on O15(perform logend)

 (5) check schematrandata on O13 (All schema's which are part of Extract)

 (6) alter extract on O15 with tranlog begin now

 
(7) unregister and register the extract on O15

 (8) start extract and pump on O15

 (9) start replicat on O13

 (10) bring appln up
 
 
 GG URL( goldengate URL)
 
 https://db.geeksinsight.com/goldengate/example-17-altering-extract-regenerating-rolling-over-etc/

