// important thing to keep in mind while doing goldengate in migration.
-- Whenever you are doing migration with the help of goldengate never include sequence( manage sequence manually), include the tables only 
required for replication. remove the temporary tables from replication


-- Keep in mind to check on SGA and PGA while doing data migration in oracle DB 12c, always compare the parameters between two DBs
(1) sequence contention - check sequence cache.
(2) ADDM , AWR report
(3) check the alert log file - ASGDBA should have access to grid 
(4) coding error
(5) pagation and procedure check
(6) after changing PGA / SGA, do rolling db bounce( DB bounce is required)


