This issue occurs if you have the following prerequisites :

1. Replicat ABEND (for example, ORA-00001 output because there was data with duplicate key)
2. (On source) Change Capture read position to read the latest redo log.
   2-1. alter extract CAP01 , tranlog, begin now
   2-2. alter extract CAP01 etrollover
   2-3. info CAP01 showch
   

