https://www.oracle-scn.com/oracle-goldengate-integrated-replicat-slow-and-does-not-use-batchsql/#:~:text=The%20default%20EAGER_SIZE%20of%20the,BATCHSQL%20will%20have%20no%20effect.



-- to unregister and register existing extract while doing switchover(extract is already available in STOPPED state but if we are restarting again
after long time , we will get error as Failed to attach to logmining server) so follow below step

(1) DB login gg( ex: DBLOGIN useridalias C##GOLDENGATE DOMAIN CDBGOLDENGATE)
(2) unregister extract <extract_name> database
(3) delete extract <extract_name>
(4) register extract <extract_name> DATABASE CONTAINER(<PDBNAME>) -- here you will get SCN no, note it down
(5) ADD EXTRACT <extract_name>, INTEGRATED TRANLOG, BEGIN NOW  
(6) alter extract <extract_name>, scn <SCN_NO>
(7) ADD EXTTRAIL <Path>( ex: /ogg/oggbase/OROX4/product/ogg/G19.1/O19.3/dirdat/EXT4_7/et) , EXTRACT <extract_name>
(8) start <extract_name>

