ERROR at line 1:
ORA-20783:
Oracle GoldenGate DDL Replication setup:
*** Disconnect all sessions that are holding locks on Oracle GoldenGate metadata tables, and retry.
ORA-06512: at line 3
 
bug #13825904, where there is an enhancement that will allow the ddl_setup to run without checking the locks. 

As a workaround, please modify the params.sql

define _skip_lock_check = 'SMON'
define _skip_create_objects = 'TRUE'

** Bouncing the database can also be one of the options to let the locks to be cleared out on source, if this is acceptable.
 

Solution

1- Modify the params.sql

define _skip_lock_check = 'SMON'
define _skip_create_objects = 'TRUE'


2- Kill all session holding the locks
 


