// Steps to copy wallet and creating credentialstore from existing 

if credentialstore and wallet already exist, follow below steps:

(1) delete credentialstore

(2) purge wallet

(3) create wallet.

if it gives below error:

2020-11-19T13:06:59Z  ERROR   OGG-06127  Oracle Wallet already exists.

go to OGG_HOME/dirwlt and delete cwallet.sso 

once this is done, repeat step no.3

(4) add masterkey

(5) exit

(6) copy the cwallet.sso file from source to target or from whereever u want that cwallet.sso file.

remember, copy the cwallet.sso file from OGG_HOME/dirwlt of source to OGG_HOME/dirwlt of target

(7) copy the cwallet.sso file from OGG_HOME/dircrd of source to OGG_HOME/dircrd of target.

(8) open wallet

(9) info masterkey

(10) info credentialstore

