2020-06-25T16:36:18.887+0100  ERROR   OGG-00664  Oracle GoldenGate Delivery for Oracle, RE11TO12.prm:  
OCI Error during OCIServerAttach (status = 12514-ORA-12514: TNS:listener does not currently know of service requested in connect descriptor).



