-- link for stats gathering by oracle (recommendations)
https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/database/bi-datawarehousing/twp-bp-for-stats-gather-12c-1967354.pdf


--To check what preferences have been set, you can use the DBMS_STATS.GET_PREFS function. It takes three arguments; 
the name of the parameter, the schema name, and the table name:
