// Errors EXP-8 ORA-904 During Export error solution

. exporting pre-schema procedural objects and actions
. exporting foreign function library names for user SRIMS_DRA
. exporting PUBLIC type synonyms
EXP-00008: ORACLE error 904 encountered
ORA-00904: "DBMS_JAVA"."LONGNAME": invalid identifier
EXP-00000: Export terminated unsuccessfully


Solution: grant execute on sys.DBMS_JAVA to <user_name>;


